<CspTrustedSite xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <context>All</context>
    <description>The device live card on an Asset (lwc/deviceLiveCard) connects here, over a secure WebSocket, to receive a board's live readings from AWS IoT in ca-central-1 while the card is open.</description>
